OL,3,GNEWSAElectricity bills to rise by 2.5%
OL,4,Afrom March
OL,5,
OL,6,FElectricity bills will go up by 2.5% in
OL,7,FJersey from March 2027, it has been
OL,8,Fannounced.
OL,10,FJersey Electricity said the tariff
OL,11,Fincrease would add just over #1 per
OL,12,Fweek for a typical all-electric home
OL,13,Ffrom March 2027.
OL,15,FThe annual rate of inflation in Jersey
OL,16,Frose to 3% in September, according to
OL,17,Fthe latest figures.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
