OL,3,GNEWSAElectricity bills to rise by 2.5%
OL,4,Afrom March
OL,5,
OL,6,FChief executive Chris Ambler said: "We
OL,7,Fknow that any increase in household
OL,8,Fcosts is unwelcome, so we have worked
OL,9,Fhard to keep this rise below the
OL,10,Fisland's current rate of inflation."
